{"scenario": "debug/disassembly", "requires": ["v1", "test-hooks"], "doc": "Disassembly: `debug-frame` carries the frame's `instruction_pointer`; `debug/disassemble` is the adapter's `disassemble` around it; an instruction breakpoint is the session's own (`add-instruction`, sent in `setInstructionBreakpoints`, shown in the session's instruction view and its `debug-breakpoints` event); `debug/control` steps by instruction with `granularity`; removing the breakpoint sends the empty list."}
{"do": "start", "hub": "h"}
{"do": "write_file", "path": "$ROOT/proj/.vscode/launch.json", "json": {"version": "0.2.0", "configurations": [{"type": "mocka", "request": "launch", "name": "App", "program": "p"}]}}
{"do": "write_file", "path": "$ROOT/proj/app.c", "text": "int main() {\n  return 0;\n}\n"}
{"do": "write_file", "path": "$ROOT/a.json", "json": [{"expect": "initialize", "ok": {"supportsConfigurationDoneRequest": true, "supportsDisassembleRequest": true, "supportsInstructionBreakpoints": true, "supportsSteppingGranularity": true, "supportsConditionalBreakpoints": true}}, {"expect": "launch", "ok": {}}, {"event": "initialized"}, {"expect": "configurationDone"}, {"event": "stopped", "body": {"reason": "pause", "threadId": 1, "allThreadsStopped": true}}, {"expect": "threads", "ok": {"threads": [{"id": 1, "name": "main"}]}}, {"expect": "stackTrace", "ok": {"stackFrames": [{"id": 5, "name": "f", "line": 2, "column": 1, "source": {"path": "$ROOT/proj/app.c"}, "instructionPointerReference": "0x1000"}], "totalFrames": 1}}, {"expect": "scopes", "ok": {"scopes": [{"name": "Locals", "variablesReference": 9}]}}, {"expect": "variables", "ok": {"variables": [{"name": "count", "value": "3", "variablesReference": 0}]}}, {"expect": "disassemble", "args": {"memoryReference": "0x1000", "offset": 0, "instructionOffset": -1, "instructionCount": 3, "resolveSymbols": true}, "ok": {"instructions": [{"address": "0xff8", "instructionBytes": "55", "instruction": "push rbp", "symbol": "f"}, {"address": "0x1000", "instructionBytes": "89 e5", "instruction": "mov ebp, esp", "location": {"path": "$ROOT/proj/app.c"}, "line": 2}, {"address": "0x1004", "instruction": "ret", "line": 2, "endLine": 3}]}}, {"expect": "setInstructionBreakpoints", "args": {"breakpoints": [{"instructionReference": "0x1004", "condition": "x > 1"}]}, "ok": {"breakpoints": [{"verified": true}]}}, {"expect": "next", "args": {"threadId": 1, "granularity": "instruction"}, "ok": {}}, {"expect": "setInstructionBreakpoints", "args": {"breakpoints": []}, "ok": {"breakpoints": []}}, {"expect": "disconnect", "ok": {}}, {"die": true}]}
{"do": "connect", "conn": "e", "hub": "h"}
{"do": "send", "conn": "e", "json": {"id": 1, "method": "subscribe"}}
{"do": "expect", "conn": "e", "json": {"id": 1, "result": true}}
{"do": "send", "conn": "e", "json": {"id": 2, "method": "debug/trust", "params": {"root": "$ROOT/proj", "trusted": true}}}
{"do": "expect", "conn": "e", "json": {"id": 2, "result": true}}
{"do": "send", "conn": "e", "json": {"id": 3, "method": "debug/start", "params": {"root": "$ROOT/proj", "config": "launch:0", "adapters": [{"id": "mocka", "name": "Mock A", "types": ["mocka"], "find": {"path": "$HUB_BIN"}, "start": {"stdio": ["{program}", "debug-mock", "$ROOT/a.json"]}}]}}}
{"do": "expect", "conn": "e", "json": {"id": 3, "result": {"session": "$capture:s"}}, "within_ms": 10000}
{"do": "expect", "conn": "e", "json": {"event": "debug-frame", "data": {"session": "$s", "line": 2, "instruction_pointer": "0x1000"}}, "within_ms": 10000}
{"do": "send", "conn": "e", "json": {"id": 4, "method": "debug/disassemble", "params": {"session": "$s", "reference": "0x1000", "instruction_offset": -1, "count": 3}}}
{"do": "expect", "conn": "e", "json": {"id": 4, "result": {"instructions": [{"address": "0xff8", "bytes": "55", "instruction": "push rbp", "symbol": "f"}, {"address": "0x1000", "bytes": "89 e5", "instruction": "mov ebp, esp", "path": "$ROOT/proj/app.c", "line": 2}, {"address": "0x1004", "instruction": "ret", "line": 2, "end_line": 3}]}}, "within_ms": 10000}
{"do": "send", "conn": "e", "json": {"id": 5, "method": "debug/disassemble", "params": {"session": "$s", "reference": "0x1000", "count": 501}}}
{"do": "expect", "conn": "e", "json": {"id": 5, "error": {"code": "invalid-params"}}}
{"do": "send", "conn": "e", "json": {"id": 6, "method": "debug/breakpoints", "params": {"root": "$ROOT/proj", "session": "$s", "kind": "instruction", "op": {"op": "add-instruction", "instruction": "0x1004", "condition": "x > 1"}}}}
{"do": "expect", "conn": "e", "json": {"id": 6, "result": {"session": "$s", "breakpoints": [{"id": "i:d1:1", "n": 1, "kind": "instruction", "instruction": "0x1004", "condition": "x > 1", "verified": true, "enabled": true}]}}, "within_ms": 10000}
{"do": "expect", "conn": "e", "json": {"event": "debug-breakpoints", "data": {"session": "$s", "breakpoints": [{"n": 1, "verified": true}]}}, "within_ms": 10000}
{"do": "send", "conn": "e", "json": {"id": 7, "method": "debug/control", "params": {"session": "$s", "op": "next", "granularity": "instruction"}}}
{"do": "expect", "conn": "e", "json": {"id": 7, "result": true}, "within_ms": 10000}
{"do": "send", "conn": "e", "json": {"id": 8, "method": "debug/breakpoints", "params": {"root": "$ROOT/proj", "session": "$s", "kind": "instruction", "op": {"op": "remove-instruction", "id": 1}}}}
{"do": "expect", "conn": "e", "json": {"id": 8, "result": {"session": "$s", "breakpoints": []}}, "within_ms": 10000}
{"do": "send", "conn": "e", "json": {"id": 9, "method": "debug/control", "params": {"session": "$s", "op": "stop"}}}
{"do": "expect", "conn": "e", "json": {"id": 9, "result": true}, "within_ms": 10000}
{"do": "expect", "conn": "e", "json": {"event": "debug-ended", "data": {"session": "$s"}}, "within_ms": 10000}
